{"text": " As for Amazon, let's take a look at an intraday chart. I'm very curious to see what it's going to look like. I almost thought we could see it in the green. So Amazon earlier today, of course, we had that interesting announcement from Jeff Bezos to CNN saying that he plans to give away the bulk of his wealth over the course of his lifetime. That seemed one reason that Amazon was down. But on this spike higher, we just received an announcement that Amazon is planning to cut 10,000 workers. As soon as this week, this, of course, following that announcement that you were talking about guy the last week, saying that there was a hiring freeze. When I left my desk, I thought that we might see Amazon turn into the green right now, not so much. Taking a U-turn back down, down about 2%, maybe investors want to see this company do more guy. The stock down 40% on the year. So investors, traders really want to see what they're going to do to help out their operations.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.2, "text": " As for Amazon, let's take a look at an intraday chart.", "tokens": [50364, 1018, 337, 6795, 11, 718, 311, 747, 257, 574, 412, 364, 560, 6206, 320, 6927, 13, 50474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17489208319248298, "compression_ratio": 1.7589285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 0.26040634512901306}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.2, "end": 4.44, "text": " I'm very curious to see what it's going to look like.", "tokens": [50474, 286, 478, 588, 6369, 281, 536, 437, 309, 311, 516, 281, 574, 411, 13, 50586], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17489208319248298, "compression_ratio": 1.7589285714285714, "no_speech_prob": 0.26040634512901306}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 4.44, "end": 6.12, "text": " I almost thought we could see it in the green.", "tokens": [50586, 286, 1920, 1194, 321, 727, 536, 309, 294, 264, 3092, 13, 50670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17489208319248298, "compression_ratio": 1.7589285714285714, "no_spe